# The build context of the Dockerfile. The build stage, which is also the tools image, gets the
# repository without what is generated, local or secret; the runtime stage copies only
# package.json, package-lock.json and the compiled dist/ (DEP-R18).
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules
dist
coverage
reports
*.tsbuildinfo
.claude
docs/ai
**/.terraform
**/.tflint.d
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
